    "Each update is about 3 KB. Faster updates use more battery. Predicted arrival times are fetched only while a stop or bus is open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1回の更新は約3KBです。更新が速いほど電池を消費します。到着予測は、バス停かバスを開いている間だけ取得します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites and recent stops are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
